-- TESTING -------------------------------------------------------------------
  Tested      NexClash differential verification against the eleven recordings
              listed under Replay, one of them played by hand; simulated boot.
              Not on real hardware.

  Replay      Verify IDENTICAL on 11 recordings, 30,837 frames (R compared):
              the owner's play in Fuse (arc_h1, 7,880 frames, 37 rooms,
              autosaves stripped) and 10 scripted (8 from the archive snapshot
              through the hatch; a teleporter and the out-of-time screen from
              poked states); unit PASS (1,254 positions, 114 graphics); 30 of
              30 broken builds detected (NexClash record arc_of_yesod,
              verified 2026-11-17; this build is byte-identical to it)

  Nothing here claims a result on real hardware unless the line above says so.

-- HOW TO USE ----------------------------------------------------------------
  Put this .nxc and the game file in the same folder on the Next's card and
  choose the .nxc in the Browser. See README.txt.
